      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "content": "## Golden Signals Dashboard for: $job\nThis dashboard displays the four golden signals for the selected service, providing a high-level overview of service health.\n\n- **Latency:** The time it takes to serve a request. (p95)\n- **Traffic:** How much demand is being placed on the service. (requests/sec)\n- **Errors:** The rate of requests that are failing. (5xx errors/sec)\n- **Saturation:** How \u201cfull\u201d the service is. (JVM Memory & Threads)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Info",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
