        "content": "### \ud83d\udd0e Per-Pod Drill-Down (use when service overview looks off)\nLegends:\n- `{{pod}} \u2022 p95` for latency\n- `{{pod}} \u2022 rps` for traffic\n- `{{pod}} \u2022 5xx/s` for errors\n- `{{pod}} \u2022 {{area}}` for JVM memory regions\n- `{{pod}} \u2022 threads`\n",
